5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we book anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m tired of wasting days on travel logistics.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
