35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The all-in rate is unfair to light eaters like me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry schedule is tight; we lose two days to travel.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last year, separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more for some of us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The shared house has one bathroom for everyone.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
