46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,I prefer the urban option. The train is frequent and fast.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I prefer the whole-house option. The cost is clear.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
