49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I prefer the whole-house option. It forces us to share the day.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,It seems the whole-house option is winning.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I will accept it, but I want the train option.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
